| 9       | 8.2      |
| 10      | 5.7      |

| ProductName             | Value | Weight |
|-------------------------|-------|--------|
| Smartphone              | 200   | 1      |
| Laptop                  | 1500  | 5      |
| Headphones              | 100   | 0.5    |
| Camera                  | 800   | 2      |
| Smartwatch              | 250   | 0.3    |
| Tablet                  | 600   | 1.5    |
| Bluetooth Speaker       | 150   | 1      |
| Keyboard                | 80    | 0.8    |
| Mouse                   | 50    | 0.2    |
| Monitor                 | 300   | 3      |
| Printer                 | 400   | 4      |
| External Hard Drive     | 120   | 0.5    |
| Router                  | 60    | 0.3    |
| Power Bank              | 40    | 0.4    |
